{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53947","headline":"泛若耶宿云门 · 于武陵","name":"泛若耶宿云门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪船泛数里，渐觉少炎晖。\n暎水花连影，逢人鸟背飞。\n深犹见白石，凉好换生衣。\n未得多诗句，终须隔宿归。\n（《会稽掇英总集》卷六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于武陵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}